/* AR 길찾기 공통 오버레이. 기준: Art/Figma/실내 AR 찾기 · 직진/회전/도착 직전.png
   세 시안의 오버레이 위치는 같고, 거리 글자와 방향 그림만 다르다. */

/* Instance로 넣을 때 TemplateContainer도 화면을 채우게 한다 */
.ar-screen__overlay,
.ar-overlay {
    flex-grow: 1;
}

/* ---------- 상단 바 (시안 y55–92) ---------- */
.ar-overlay__top-bar {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    height: 38px;
    margin-top: 11px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    padding-right: 18px;
}

.ar-overlay__title {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    font-size: 13px;
    -unity-font-style: bold;
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
}

.ar-overlay__round-button {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: var(--pill-radius);
    background-color: var(--color-ar-control);
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
}

.ar-overlay__round-icon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
}

/* ---------- 남은 거리 알약 (시안 x20, y213–239) ---------- */
.ar-overlay__distance {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    align-self: flex-start;
    height: 27px;
    margin-top: 120px;
    margin-left: 20px;
    padding-left: 10px;
    padding-right: 13px;
    border-radius: 13.5px;
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
}

.ar-overlay__distance-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-right: 7px;
}

.ar-overlay__distance-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    -unity-font-style: bold;
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
}

/* ---------- 방향 표시 (왼쪽 아래, 지름 92, 흰 테두리 4) ---------- */
.ar-overlay__direction {
    position: absolute;
    left: 18px;
    bottom: 22px;
    width: 92px;
    height: 92px;
    border-width: 4px;
    border-color: var(--color-background);
    border-radius: var(--pill-radius);
    background-color: var(--color-map-background);
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
}

.ar-overlay__direction-graphic {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
}

/* ---------- 목적지 카드 (오른쪽 아래, 136 x 50) ---------- */
.ar-overlay__destination {
    position: absolute;
    right: 18px;
    bottom: 22px;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 136px;
    height: 50px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    padding-right: 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
}

.ar-overlay__destination-circle {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
}

.ar-overlay__destination-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
}

.ar-overlay__destination-text {
    margin-left: 8px;
}

.ar-overlay__destination-name {
    font-size: 11px;
    -unity-font-style: bold;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
}

.ar-overlay__destination-room {
    margin-top: 1px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
}
